category: Games
requires: cygwin libgcc1 libSDL2_2.0_0 libSDL2_mixer2.0_0 libstdc++6
sdesc: "Dark 2D side-scrolling platform game"
ldesc: "Abuse is a dark 2D side-scrolling platform game developed by Crack dot Com in
1995. It features beautiful lighting, realistic animation and nasty alien-like
creatures to destroy. It is now maintained by Sam Hocevar in an attempt to
prevent it from vanishing from the Internet."

